msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "NEC - PC Engine / CD (Beetle PCE FAST)"
msgstr "NEC - PC Engine / CD (Beetle PCE FAST)"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "Beetle PC Engine Fast is a fork of Mednafen's PC Engine Fast driver.[CR][CR]Compared to Beetle PC Engine, the fast version trades away typically unnecessary accuracy in favor of speed."
msgstr "Beetle PC Engine Fast è un fork del driver PC Engine Fast di Mednafen.[CR][CR]Rispetto a Beetle PC Engine, la versione veloce rinuncia alla precisione solitamente non necessaria in favore della velocità."

